    {
      "name": "places/ChIJp4_ZYX3zaS4RJqjlDvRoPEY/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNfLTVtQ3N3RRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "The cafe is located beside the 'G' mie resto. Parking lot can contain several cars and motors, not too many cars can be parked here.\n\nThe concept is semi outdoor and they provide with a quite big AC room. Recently, they provide also with kids area. Overall the athmosphere is quite cozy.\n\nThe good...hmm...quite good as I can not say 'special'. I ordered capucino with some foods at the picture.\n\nMy suggestion to the resto:\n- provide more wastafels to make easy for us washing our hands before eating\n- think you should consider abt the price\n- some music at the background -live- may add the ambience more enjoyable, rather than nothing to hear or sound of motors",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "The cafe is located beside the 'G' mie resto. Parking lot can contain several cars and motors, not too many cars can be parked here.\n\nThe concept is semi outdoor and they provide with a quite big AC room. Recently, they provide also with kids area. Overall the athmosphere is quite cozy.\n\nThe good...hmm...quite good as I can not say 'special'. I ordered capucino with some foods at the picture.\n\nMy suggestion to the resto:\n- provide more wastafels to make easy for us washing our hands before eating\n- think you should consider abt the price\n- some music at the background -live- may add the ambience more enjoyable, rather than nothing to hear or sound of motors",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
